Epoch_childDeposit_CcipFork
├── given the active strategy is remote on Base
├── and Parent and Child have fork crosschain vault allowlists configured
├── and the epoch has net deposits
├── when CRE closes the epoch through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── and local CCIP routes USDC to Base
├── then ParentVault should mark the epoch claimable
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
├── and ChildVault should deposit net USDC into Base Aave V3
└── and ChildVault should set Base Aave V3 as the active adapter
